   "THE TRAP: on PCBAG123, 2 flashes = pressure switch stuck CLOSED and 3 = stuck OPEN; on PCBAG127 it's REVERSED (2 = stuck open, 3 = stuck closed) — both full tables are in Error Codes",
   "PCBAG127 amber LED reads the flame side: ON = normal flame, OFF = no flame, 1 flash = low flame current (clean the sensor), 2 = flame with valve off",
