  "summary": "A single-stage Trane furnace shows no inducer on a heat call and the tech jumps straight to the pressure switch. The IFC actually powers the switch through the limit string, so an open thermal limit leaves no 24VAC at the pressure switch at all. Reading the wrong end of that circuit sends techs after the wrong part.",
