  "summary": "On a Goodman MBR or AR air handler the blower seems to start late in cooling and, in electric heat, appears to be driven by the heat sequencer rather than the thermostat. That is by design: the EBTDR board handles cooling delays, but in heating the blower is energized through the EBTDR normally closed contacts tied to sequencer terminal M1.",
