   "If the control settings are in an unknown state, use the rSt (Reset) menu item to return settings to factory default, then reprogram from the rating plate.",
   "Verify 115-V wiring and ground are maintained with correct polarity. Improper polarity produces a rapid flashing diagnostic light with status code 10.1 and the furnace will not operate.",
