   "Measure gas supply pressure - it must be greater than 4.5 in. w.c. (0.16 psig) and must not exceed 14 in. w.c. (0.5 psig).",
   "Check all manual-reset switches for continuity before starting the unit.",
   "Confirm the blower door is in place; it completes the 115-V circuit that supplies power to the furnace components."
