   "On an existing system, reach that scan from the home screen: menu icon, Settings, Advanced Settings, View Support Service Control Center, Equipment Settings, Reset, Re-Configure System.",
   "When the Smart Zoning screen appears, select each zone to rename it using a predefined or custom name, then press done and continue.",
   "If a particular zone is missing from the list, verify the zone sensor wiring and confirm the zone address is set correctly on that zone sensor.",
   "Continue to the Verify Airflow Per Zone screen and make the required CFM adjustment for each zone before finishing commissioning.",
   "Do not accept a partial equipment list and move on - a zone that was never detected will not be controllable later."
