   "Follow the display through the sequence: tSt confirms start, PUr runs the inducer on high for 10 seconds (the inducer remains on for the test duration), a gas valve communication check runs for 15 seconds, HSi runs the hot surface igniter on for 15 seconds, and Fn runs the blower at 50 percent torque for 10 seconds.",
