  "summary": "A ceiling-suspended or ducted indoor unit is commissioned without a drain check and comes back as a water leak. The commissioning sequence calls for a verified slope of at least 1/4 inch per foot, a 2 inch space at the termination, and an actual leak and drainage check including any field-provided condensate pump.",
