  "summary": "A Daikin DM96SN is commissioned with the bottom panel knockouts still open because the return was ducted into the side. Those perforations leak air into the cabinet and undermine both airflow and combustion safety. The startup procedure calls for verifying every sealing component before the unit is fired.",
