  "summary": "You need to prove out the defrost thermostat and defrost board on a Goodman packaged heat pump. The manual's method is to disable the outdoor fan at the DF2 terminal so frost builds, then short the board's test pins to force defrost. Watch the timing - the short must be removed the instant the reversing valve shifts or the defrost period lasts only 3 seconds.",
