  "summary": "The compressor monitor module on a Daikin R-32 single-stage condenser is flashing yellow ALERT code 1: the compressor is running extremely long cycles, which the manual attributes to low capacity from a low-side fault. Work the list in order rather than assuming low charge - a stopped blower, a frozen coil, or a plugged metering device produce the same code. R-32 is an A2L refrigerant, so follow your A2L handling and leak-check practices before opening the system.",
