  "equipment": "Condenser/Heat Pump",
  "title": "Goodman GSX/GSZ - decoding 2-wire Comfort Alert yellow ALERT flash codes 1 to 9",
  "summary": "A Goodman GSX or GSZ condenser has a 2-wire Comfort Alert module flashing a yellow ALERT code. Each flash count maps to a specific fault family, and codes 5, 6, and 7 in particular separate an open circuit from a damaged start winding versus a damaged run winding - useful before you pull the compressor.",
