  "summary": "You are closing out a charge job on a DX16TC or DZ18TC. Two things get missed: the service valve cap is the secondary seal and has a specific make-up procedure, and the manual explicitly says not to adjust the TXV at light load conditions of 55 to 60 F - an adjustment made there will be wrong at design conditions.",
