  "summary": "On a Daikin FIT R-32 system the manual gives a hard number for compressor winding insulation: below 30 megohms, replace the compressor. Note the criterion is model-family specific - the FIT R-410A manual instead calls for a reading of infinity - so check the manual for the exact system in front of you before condemning anything.",
