  "id": "s-lennox-minisplit-e464-overcurrent",
  "equipment": "Mini-Split",
  "title": "Lennox mini-split - E464 overcurrent on compressor 1 (inverter PCB diode and DC link tests)",
  "summary": "A Lennox MWLD/MWPD/MWHD/MMPD/MMLD mini-split is throwing E464, overcurrent on compressor 1. The published troubleshooting is a diode and resistance check across the inverter PCB power section plus a DC link voltage test - and the DC link test requires letting the bus capacitors discharge first.",
