   "Add the negative and positive readings together for total external static; both may be read simultaneously on the manometer.",
   "Consult the air handler airflow chart for that model to find CFM at the measured external static pressure.",
   "Record which configuration you measured, since the same numeric total means different things on the two arrangements."
