  "title": "Trane S9V2 - adding up equivalent vent length before condemning a pressure switch",
  "summary": "A condensing Trane S9V2 nuisance-trips its pressure switch and the vent looks short by eye. Elbows and terminations carry large equivalent-length penalties, so the real number is often far above the measured pipe run, and the limit applies to each pipe separately, not to the combined total.",
