  "summary": "Inverter PBA 1 reports a DC link voltage sensing error. The procedure walks supply voltage, EMI PCB fuses, the reactor coil, and finally a live DC link reading to decide between the inverter board and the fan board. Stored DC is lethal - the 15 to 20 minute wait is not optional.",
