  "title": "Reversing valve will not shift - 24 V at the coil, tapping the body, then coil continuity",
  "summary": "The standard Goodman/Daikin sequence separates a signal problem from a coil problem from a stuck valve body. The order matters: voltage first, then the tap, then coil continuity.",
