   "Let the system run and watch the readings until superheat and subcooling stop drifting.",
   "If the house is already satisfied and there is no load, build load or come back - do not charge into a low load condition.",
   "If conditions cannot be met, recover and weigh in the factory charge plus the documented line set adjustment instead of charging to a number.",
   "Document the outdoor dry bulb, indoor wet bulb, runtime, and final numbers on the ticket."
