   "Change fan speed only at the adjustable sheave, and re-tension the belt afterward",
   "Measure blower motor amps before and after any sheave change and never leave the motor above its nameplate FLA",
   "Measure blower RPM and total external static, and inspect the wheel for dirt loading"
