   "Look the can over for a domed top, bulged sides, or oil residue at the base",
   "If the compressor half is weak, replace the whole capacitor - you cannot replace one section",
   "After replacement, clamp the compressor common lead and confirm it pulls in and settles at a normal running amp draw"
